    {
      "id": "msg_0138_00101",
      "en_US": "Thank you for accessing!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0138_00102",
      "en_US": "Welcome to the Museum Shop!\\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0138_00103",
      "en_US": [
        "Wow, you have such good eyes! Can\\n",
        "I tell you about my last dream? {YESNO, 0, 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0138_00104",
      "en_US": [
        "Hmmm... My discerning eyes must have\\n",
        "become weak..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0138_00105",
      "en_US": [
        "I used to love Jump events.\\r",
        "The record I have from when I was fully\\n",
        "active as a Pokéathlete is 998 jumps!\\r",
        "Just two more!\\n",
        "All I had to make was two more!\\r",
        "I had to retire due to my age...\\n",
        "Could I ask you to jump 1,000 times\\f",
        "for me?\\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0138_00106",
      "en_US": [
        "Well, the record may make you dizzy.\\n",
        "But you’re still young.\\f",
        "You can do it!\\r",
        "I’ll just sit and wait."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0138_00107",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh! You!\\n",
        "It is so wonderful of you!\\f",
        "You have jumped 1,000 times.\\r",
        "Thank you so much!\\n",
        "This is just a token of my appreciation.\\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0138_00108",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m now your fan. I’m old as you see,\\n",
        "but I will support you no matter what."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0138_00109",
      "en_US": [
        "You know what?\\n",
        "I have tackled over 500 times finally!\\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0138_00110",
      "en_US": [
        "Haha!\\n",
        "You’re doing fine, but not as good\\f",
        "as me. I wonder if any Pokéathlete\\f",
        "could be better at tackling than me.\\f",
        "Sigh..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0138_00111",
      "en_US": [
        "You know what?\\n",
        "I have tackled over 1,000 times!\\f",
        "Finally!\\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0138_00112",
      "en_US": [
        "You know what? I’ve finally tackled\\n",
        "over 2,000 times! I bet no one can\\f",
        "break this record easily!\\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0138_00113",
      "en_US": [
        "......!\\n",
        "No! That’s not right!\\f",
        "Your record beats mine?\\r",
        "Nooooo!\\n",
        "...OK. You win.\\r",
        "I admit complete defeat.\\n",
        "Please take this.\\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0138_00114",
      "en_US": [
        "Whew!\\n",
        "It’s strange, but I feel great.\\r",
        "I do regret that I lost, but it made\\n",
        "me know where I am.\\r",
        "I understand that there are many\\n",
        "Pokéathletes better than me.\\r",
        "This is where I begin to grow again!\\n",
        "Keep up the good work!"
      ]
    }
  ]
